{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-06T11:59:38.533Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e5330e1791f32ab2f4c04d76","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1676","claim:pm-gh1677","lineage:pm-gh1677","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1676+pm-gh1677","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1676","claim:pm-gh1677","lineage:pm-gh1677","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-06T11:59:38.533Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-06T11:59:38.533Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation evidence (branch fix/recovery-replays-invocation). The store-layer refusal (assertRevisionEntries in src/core/store/item-mutation-precondition.ts) now builds required/examples/nextSteps through itemRevisionConflictGuidance and records reason revision_changed or document_unreadable. scopeItemRevisionConflict in src/sdk/lifecycle/item-revision.ts re-renders those fields for an invocation ({scopeArgs, json}). It runs inside enrichItemRevisionConflict, so it also covers refusals that already carry change evidence, and it skips close's post-close fan-out report (reason post_close_auto_unblock_refused, already scoped by commandScope). Hosts: the CLI binds invocationRevisionRecovery(globalOptions) (resolvePmCommandScopeArgs: --pm-path spelling, PM_PATH when not the cwd default, --no-extensions, and JSON when --json or --output-format json) at both preAction bind sites in src/cli/main.ts. SDK withExpectedItemRevisions adds --pm-path for an explicit pmRoot or cwd, PmClient.withExpectedItemRevisions always names its tracker, and runAction/MCP pass resolvePmCommandScopeArgs(global). Verified with the reporter's two-tracker shape: the emitted next_steps now read the target item at current_revision, and the history step returns the target's stream (total 2) in the caller's output mode. The guard still exits 4 and writes nothing. Negative control: dropping the invocation from enrichInvocationRevisionError fails tests/integration/recovery-replays-invocation.integration.spec.ts."}]}],"before_hash":"bb8769091deb0530f5175dbb76581ee2ab8ec9f883fb3efdc80c733512261339","after_hash":"ac306ea2612581dadeca466a12925651ff6192288ea59449caa93519c51df4d4","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"9defe540892e415ea9bb796fd470761996bb6d4ce56351597303cc16468ac673"}
