sions, and runAction/MCP pass their tracker scope. Close's post-close fan-out report keeps its own scoped commands."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Verified with the reporter's two-tracker shape (same id in a decoy and a target tracker). The emitted get returned the target item with item_hash equal to current_revision and the edited description. The emitted history returned the target stream (total 2) in JSON, and the TOON refusal emits TOON reads. Removing the invocation from the CLI enrichment fails tests/integration/cli/recovery-replays-invocation.integration.spec.ts (negative control). Full suite 12112 passed, coverage 100/100/100/100."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"A stale-revision refusal's read-only recovery now carries the caller's tracker scope, extension isolation and output mode, so replaying it reads the refused item"}],"before_hash":"63ab26046ca134c2d672613bee72ca72f0d0ed136823ab1b1b8d5dd186df3b31","after_hash":"66b9b123b3fa5cbff040f590ae84a0823ec33de2ac7b442f30502d232f6314df","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:45:21.027Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"86389d8bb7f238f7c6881cd1a38f48f095bc5199057b2b728cf73525c191c480"}
